l\nOpen media 2 in modal\nOpen media 3 in modal\nOpen media 4 in modal\nOpen media 5 in modal\nOpen media 6 in modal\n1\n/\nof\n6\nSmart 600W PS-SPD-0600NPCWxx-W\nSmart 600W PS-SPD-0600NPCWxx-W\nSKU:PS-SPD-0600NPCWxx-W\n80 PLUS® Standard Certified APFC PSU\n600W\n500W\n700W\nView full details\nDesign\nSpecification\nDownload\nHow-to Videos\nThermaltake Smart Series  Incorporating various high-quality components, the Smart Series – models are rated from 500W to 700W – saves energy through its high efficiency of up to 86% and accommodates any mainstream build with the most demanding requirements. An embedded intelligent cooling fan delivers excellent airflow at an exceptionally low noise level. Additionally, the Single +12V rail design enables non-stop usage with stable and reliable performance.  120mm Ultra Quiet Fan Smart Series adopt 120mm cooling fan delivers excellent airflow at an exceptionally low noise level.  Multiple Connectors The cables used for Smart Series are black and low-profile, users are able to properly route the cables in optimal location to prevent airflow blockage. Connector TypeConnector QuantityCable QuantityCable LengthMain Power(24Pin) X 1 X 1600mm ATX 12V(4+4Pin) X 1 X 1650mm PCIe  (6+2Pin) X 2 X 1500mm+150mm SATA (4Pin) X 4 X 1 500mm+150mm +150mm+150mm Peripheral (4Pin) X 4 X 1 500mm+150mm +150mm+150mm  80 PLUS Standard Certified and Intel C6/C7 States Ready Smart Series saves energy through its high energy efficiency of up to 80% and is 80 PLUS® Standard Certified. It has been optimized to work with all generations of Intel’s processors to achieve maximum energy saving.  High-Quality Components High quality components enable non-stop usage with stable and reliable performance, no more capacitor explosion and leakage.  High Amperage Single +12V Rail Design Smart Series is equipped with a powerful +12V rail, superior performance under all types of system loading. AC INPUTInput Voltage: 100 - 240Vac Input Current: 12A Max Frequency: 50 - 60Hz DC OUTPUT+3.3V+5V+12V-12V+5VsbMax Output Current18A18A50A 0.3A2.5AMax Output Power100W600W 3.6W 12.5W Continuous Power600W\nProduct Specifications\nP/N\nPS-SPD-0600NPCWxx-W\nColor\nBlack\nDimensions\n150mm(W) x 86mm(H) x 140mm(D)\nPFC (Power Factor Correction)\nActive PFC\nPower Good Signal\n100-500 msec\nHold Up Time\n> 12msec at full load\nInput Current\n12A Max\nInput Frequency Range\n50 – 60Hz\nInput Voltage\n100 – 240Vac\nOperating Temperture\n5°C to + 40°C\nOperating Humidity\n20% to 85%, non-condensing\nStorage Temperture\n-40°C to + 55°C\nStorage Humidity\n10% to 95%, non-condensing\nCooling System\n12cm sleeve fan\nEfficiency\nMeet 80 PLUS® at 115Vac input.\nMTBF\n100,000 hrs minimum\nSafety Approval\ncTUVus/FCC/S-Mark\nPCI-E 6+2PIN\n2\nUser Manual\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nSMART 500 600 700W Manual\n2024-02-27\nDrivers & Software\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nContact Us\nGeneral Information\nSales Partner Request\nLAN Party Request\nMedia Contact\nSupport\nWarranty Policy\nHow to find S/N\neRMA Service\nTechnical Support\nSoftware Downloads\nCommunity\nJoin TT Mod\nCaseMOD Invitation\nForums\nMarketing Materials\nCompany\nAbout Us\nWhere to Buy\nPrivacy Policy\nPress Release\nCollaboration\nThe Tower 300 Wilier Edition\nTT x Wilier\nTR100 Koralie Edition\nLCGS Store\nFlagship Store\nSystem Lecture\nSystem Workshop\nVideos\nTT Camp\nLocation\nGlobal\nAustralia\nBrazil\nChina\nGermany\nJapan\nKorea\nLatam\nPoland\nRussia\nSpain\nTaiwan\nThailand\nTurkey\nUK\nUSA\nSubscribe to our emails\nEmail\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTwitter\nTwitch\nReddit\nCopyright © 2026 Thermaltake Technology Co., Ltd. All Rights Reserved.\nChoosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\nOpens in a new window.",
